(4476544, 645359, 89230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but next time you may want to shoot (or crop) the bridge to be level with the horizon. A great shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but next time you may want to shoot (or crop) the bridge to be level with the horizon. A great shot nonetheless.', '2008-02-11 00:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
