(4476555, 645470, 89230, '<td valign="top">I had a lot of ideas for this challenge, and most of the photos Ive seen on here I had thought of. This one never crossed my mind. Great idea.</td>', 'I had a lot of ideas for this challenge, and most of the photos Ive seen on here I had thought of. This one never crossed my mind. Great idea.', '2008-02-11 01:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
