(4480545, 643621, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the reason for the nude but I really like the single yellow picture on the wall.</td>', 'Not sure about the reason for the nude but I really like the single yellow picture on the wall.', '2008-02-12 13:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480548, 644702, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet and gentle and the reflection is incredibly clean.  Golf course, I assume?</td>', 'Sweet and gentle and the reflection is incredibly clean.  Golf course, I assume?', '2008-02-12 13:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480550, 643021, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice!!</td>', 'Nice!!', '2008-02-12 13:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480552, 643692, 30982, '<td valign="top">The reflection seems almost cleaner than the real thing.  I like the way you composed this.</td>', 'The reflection seems almost cleaner than the real thing.  I like the way you composed this.', '2008-02-12 13:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480553, 645536, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wondermous!  A bit of noise in the sky - may have pushed the processing just a bit?  Really good take on the challenge, though.</td>', 'Wondermous!  A bit of noise in the sky - may have pushed the processing just a bit?  Really good take on the challenge, though.', '2008-02-12 13:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480559, 645390, 31133, '<td valign="top">Well this fits the challenge as far as "reflective surface" goes, but I think the image quality is suffering. A polarizing filter would eliminate the strong white on the water, but since that is itself a reflection, maybe that''s what you''re going for! The parts around the green covered rocks seem a little oversharpened. The positive for me is that it meets the challenge and it''s a pretty good composition. I like the way the shoreline curve echoes the curve from the foreground sand.</td>', 'Well this fits the challenge as far as "reflective surface" goes, but I think the image quality is suffering. A polarizing filter would eliminate the strong white on the water, but since that is itself a reflection, maybe that''s what you''re going for! The parts around the green covered rocks seem a little oversharpened. The positive for me is that it meets the challenge and it''s a pretty good composition. I like the way the shoreline curve echoes the curve from the foreground sand.', '2008-02-12 13:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480560, 645464, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool abstractish kinda thing.</td>', 'Very cool abstractish kinda thing.', '2008-02-12 13:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480563, 645492, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice complimentary reflections.</td>', 'Nice complimentary reflections.', '2008-02-12 13:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480564, 644027, 31133, '<td valign="top">Oooh! I like how one has to look closely in the window to see the books reflected with the venetian blind background. I bet other people give you the same comment, but I will say it too: The plywood on the right draws my eye right over to that side, away from the books. I bet this could be a point or more higher if the crop showed only the dark wood frame of the door or window. I like the patterns made from the blinds and perpendicular books.</td>', 'Oooh! I like how one has to look closely in the window to see the books reflected with the venetian blind background. I bet other people give you the same comment, but I will say it too: The plywood on the right draws my eye right over to that side, away from the books. I bet this could be a point or more higher if the crop showed only the dark wood frame of the door or window. I like the patterns made from the blinds and perpendicular books.', '2008-02-12 13:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480568, 642592, 31133, '<td valign="top">For me this image has everything going for it except for the angle of the bridge. It seems so separate from that lonely tree (perhaps that''s what you''re going for). I wonder how it would look if the view were from about ten steps to the right, so the bridge appeared to go much nearer the tree. I like the silky sky and the browns in the bridge reflection.</td>', 'For me this image has everything going for it except for the angle of the bridge. It seems so separate from that lonely tree (perhaps that''s what you''re going for). I wonder how it would look if the view were from about ten steps to the right, so the bridge appeared to go much nearer the tree. I like the silky sky and the browns in the bridge reflection.', '2008-02-12 13:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480572, 644448, 31133, '<td valign="top">Good title :-) This would be really eye-catching if the white part on the right were cropped out. Hope you don''t mind my input, but I guess you don''t if you''ve entered a challenge. I think the image quality is excellent, but it might benefit from a bit of increased saturation and contrast in the reflection. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Good title :-) This would be really eye-catching if the white part on the right were cropped out. Hope you don''t mind my input, but I guess you don''t if you''ve entered a challenge. I think the image quality is excellent, but it might benefit from a bit of increased saturation and contrast in the reflection. Good luck in the challenge!', '2008-02-12 13:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480574, 645602, 31133, '<td valign="top">ewww, I do wonder what this is. It''s definitely wonderful image quality and beautiful tones.</td>', 'ewww, I do wonder what this is. It''s definitely wonderful image quality and beautiful tones.', '2008-02-12 13:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480576, 645367, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a perfectly still day this must have been! There''s a bit too much going on I think, but you certainly have met the challenge. This might be a nice texture overlay.</td>', 'What a perfectly still day this must have been! There''s a bit too much going on I think, but you certainly have met the challenge. This might be a nice texture overlay.', '2008-02-12 13:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480580, 645461, 31133, '<td valign="top">This makes me feel like I''m underwater. This is definitely an image that only gets better the more you look at it. It''s dynamic and got a great 3D feeling to it. Nice work!</td>', 'This makes me feel like I''m underwater. This is definitely an image that only gets better the more you look at it. It''s dynamic and got a great 3D feeling to it. Nice work!', '2008-02-12 14:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480582, 644462, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset. Since the goose is the subject, I''d love to see him a bit more clearly ... perhaps with some processing or a fill flash.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset. Since the goose is the subject, I''d love to see him a bit more clearly ... perhaps with some processing or a fill flash.', '2008-02-12 14:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480583, 645386, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition!</td>', 'Beautiful composition!', '2008-02-12 14:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480584, 644615, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful! I really like the processing. Every time I try to do this kind of processing, it looks terrible. Yours is very, very appealing. It''s an adorable reflection, too.</td>', 'This is wonderful! I really like the processing. Every time I try to do this kind of processing, it looks terrible. Yours is very, very appealing. It''s an adorable reflection, too.', '2008-02-12 14:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480644, 645049, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do like your choice of perspective - makes the castle seem more inviting and warm in its reflection than in its reality.</td>', 'I do like your choice of perspective - makes the castle seem more inviting and warm in its reflection than in its reality.', '2008-02-12 14:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480645, 645462, 30982, '<td valign="top">Delicious calm and indeed quite serene.</td>', 'Delicious calm and indeed quite serene.', '2008-02-12 14:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480646, 645334, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely water painting!</td>', 'A lovely water painting!', '2008-02-12 14:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480647, 645554, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of shot I like to take as well - where the real and the reflected are so intermingled it''s hard to tell them apart at times.  Nice.</td>', 'This is the kind of shot I like to take as well - where the real and the reflected are so intermingled it''s hard to tell them apart at times.  Nice.', '2008-02-12 14:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480657, 644766, 75343, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and detail!!!!</td>', 'Nice composition and detail!!!!', '2008-02-12 14:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480664, 645386, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet subtle shot - I can hear the quiet.</td>', 'Sweet subtle shot - I can hear the quiet.', '2008-02-12 14:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480672, 642592, 30982, '<td valign="top">I know it has nothing to do with the reflection, but I love that lone tree out there.  Seems to be turning its back on the domination of the bridge structure.</td>', 'I know it has nothing to do with the reflection, but I love that lone tree out there.  Seems to be turning its back on the domination of the bridge structure.', '2008-02-12 14:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
