(4480802, 645356, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh don''t we all wish!  Wonderful light for the reflection - I love how the windows are lit in the water.</td>', 'Oh don''t we all wish!  Wonderful light for the reflection - I love how the windows are lit in the water.', '2008-02-12 15:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480804, 645363, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture - I like the interplay between the geese and the simple but effective reflections at the top to "ground" the framing.</td>', 'Very nice capture - I like the interplay between the geese and the simple but effective reflections at the top to "ground" the framing.', '2008-02-12 15:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480805, 645425, 30982, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm.  Lovely.</td>', 'Mmmmm.  Lovely.', '2008-02-12 15:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480806, 645505, 30982, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile!  What a great idea, and what an excellent day to ride!</td>', 'This makes me smile!  What a great idea, and what an excellent day to ride!', '2008-02-12 15:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480808, 645576, 30982, '<td valign="top">Busy!  And very fun to look at and enjoy.  A cacaphony (sp?) of color and shape, and a hidden treasure of reflections as well.</td>', 'Busy!  And very fun to look at and enjoy.  A cacaphony (sp?) of color and shape, and a hidden treasure of reflections as well.', '2008-02-12 15:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480809, 644451, 30982, '<td valign="top">Surreal - almost looks as though the building is on fire inside.</td>', 'Surreal - almost looks as though the building is on fire inside.', '2008-02-12 15:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480810, 644253, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, that is not a good thing, to be able to see the ceiling light in the floor.  Hopefully that got fixed.</td>', 'Oh yes, that is not a good thing, to be able to see the ceiling light in the floor.  Hopefully that got fixed.', '2008-02-12 15:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480811, 645572, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clever choice and nicely done!</td>', 'Clever choice and nicely done!', '2008-02-12 15:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480812, 643049, 30982, '<td valign="top">Delightful!</td>', 'Delightful!', '2008-02-12 15:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480813, 643888, 30982, '<td valign="top">I tried this - you did it MUCH better.  Rich and intriguing.</td>', 'I tried this - you did it MUCH better.  Rich and intriguing.', '2008-02-12 15:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480821, 644362, 55956, '<td valign="top">I like this photo!</td>', 'I like this photo!', '2008-02-12 15:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480825, 644619, 55956, '<td valign="top">fantastic idea, well done the photo.10</td>', 'fantastic idea, well done the photo.10', '2008-02-12 16:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480841, 645472, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice color and creative concept.  Some of the light is harsh, obviously difficult to avoid and I wonder if it might have had more punch with either a tighter crop or another row of discs to fill the frame.  Great overall effect.</td>', 'Nice color and creative concept.  Some of the light is harsh, obviously difficult to avoid and I wonder if it might have had more punch with either a tighter crop or another row of discs to fill the frame.  Great overall effect.', '2008-02-12 16:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480843, 644720, 55956, '<td valign="top">great image. 10</td>', 'great image. 10', '2008-02-12 16:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480862, 645575, 83080, '<td valign="top">I like your creative and insightful interpretation. It''s the sort of idea that may get some DNMCs, but sometimes I do wish dpc had more people that took the creative part of the challenge as seriously as the photography part of the challenge.  I think you might have satisfied potential DNMCs with this same concept if you had placed the models on either side of a glass door (using the reflection to add a layer of interest) or if you had included a literal reflection of the subjects somewhere in the composition.<br/> <br/>On the photo side, the whites on much of the adult subject''s garment are over exposed and the shaddow/vignetting on the left is distracting for me.<br/> <br/>Nice contribution to the creative interpretation side.</td>', 'I like your creative and insightful interpretation. It''s the sort of idea that may get some DNMCs, but sometimes I do wish dpc had more people that took the creative part of the challenge as seriously as the photography part of the challenge.  I think you might have satisfied potential DNMCs with this same concept if you had placed the models on either side of a glass door (using the reflection to add a layer of interest) or if you had included a literal reflection of the subjects somewhere in the composition. On the photo side, the whites on much of the adult subject''s garment are over exposed and the shaddow/vignetting on the left is distracting for me. Nice contribution to the creative interpretation side.', '2008-02-12 16:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480877, 644311, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a tough image to comment on (at least for me, heehee). It''s excellent image quality, but the subject just isn''t that interesting to me, and that feels not too polite to say. But I''m trying to make an effort at helpful comments, so I''ll say it and hope it''s not offensive. The colors are nice, and I''m sure the ice sculpture took a lot of work to make, but I guess I would like to see some life there, maybe the person in the act of creating the sculpture, for example. Good luck on the challenge and keep shooting!</td>', 'This is a tough image to comment on (at least for me, heehee). It''s excellent image quality, but the subject just isn''t that interesting to me, and that feels not too polite to say. But I''m trying to make an effort at helpful comments, so I''ll say it and hope it''s not offensive. The colors are nice, and I''m sure the ice sculpture took a lot of work to make, but I guess I would like to see some life there, maybe the person in the act of creating the sculpture, for example. Good luck on the challenge and keep shooting!', '2008-02-12 16:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480880, 645492, 31133, '<td valign="top">Love the strong, golden yellows on the skyscrapers, not so crazy about the super blue at the top. The one building reflected in the other meets the challenge very well and it''s a nice image.</td>', 'Love the strong, golden yellows on the skyscrapers, not so crazy about the super blue at the top. The one building reflected in the other meets the challenge very well and it''s a nice image.', '2008-02-12 16:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480884, 644618, 31133, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice. The diagonal crop works really well here. I wonder if it might be even more impactfull (not a word, sorry) if the colors in that beautiful umbrella were boosted and brightened even more?</td>', 'Simple and nice. The diagonal crop works really well here. I wonder if it might be even more impactfull (not a word, sorry) if the colors in that beautiful umbrella were boosted and brightened even more?', '2008-02-12 16:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480893, 644768, 31133, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it was what you wanted to do with the strong green or cyan color over the whites... I think it would be awesome with white whites and black blacks, at least around the boats. This looks like an incredibly beautiful location.</td>', 'Not sure if it was what you wanted to do with the strong green or cyan color over the whites... I think it would be awesome with white whites and black blacks, at least around the boats. This looks like an incredibly beautiful location.', '2008-02-12 16:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480896, 645516, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s great how her shirt and sunglasses match the poster so perfectly!</td>', 'It''s great how her shirt and sunglasses match the poster so perfectly!', '2008-02-12 16:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4480900, 644618, 83080, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It brought brought to mind <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=49109" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">eyewave</a>''s <i>A Stroll Under The Rainbow</i>:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=602868'', strrpos(''//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=602868'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=602868"/> <br/> <br/>Different umbrella &amp; composition I know, but I was just looking at that shot recently, so the rainbow umbrella struck me.</td>', 'I like this.  It brought brought to mind  eyewave''s A Stroll Under The Rainbow:   Different umbrella & composition I know, but I was just looking at that shot recently, so the rainbow umbrella struck me.', '2008-02-12 16:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
