(4480973, 643551, 83080, '<td valign="top">Cool picture.  The bubbles are a bit too much for me, particularly given the overall brightness of the frame.  I''m very curious about how you composed this shot.</td>', 'Cool picture.  The bubbles are a bit too much for me, particularly given the overall brightness of the frame.  I''m very curious about how you composed this shot.', '2008-02-12 17:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481000, 645580, 83080, '<td valign="top">I love the saturation of the reflected colors.  It really draws attention to that reflective surface in the spirit of the challenge.  I wonder what it would have looked like with the wheel turned more to the right (just imagining, not a criticism).</td>', 'I love the saturation of the reflected colors.  It really draws attention to that reflective surface in the spirit of the challenge.  I wonder what it would have looked like with the wheel turned more to the right (just imagining, not a criticism).', '2008-02-12 17:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
