(4481026, 645351, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition.  I think you would have been within the rules to edit out a couple of the incidental specks in the orb (the big middle speck in particular). They give a subtle dirty feel that detracts slightly for me.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition.  I think you would have been within the rules to edit out a couple of the incidental specks in the orb (the big middle speck in particular). They give a subtle dirty feel that detracts slightly for me.', '2008-02-12 17:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
