(4481063, 644149, 83080, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!  This is a real <i>thinker</i> and I hope all the voters take time to appreciate your composition.  The reflected sky is a bit strong and I wonder if you could have done this at a different time of day to balance it out (of course, then the parking spots might not be filled).  This is one of my favorites.  Thanks!</td>', 'Brilliant!  This is a real thinker and I hope all the voters take time to appreciate your composition.  The reflected sky is a bit strong and I wonder if you could have done this at a different time of day to balance it out (of course, then the parking spots might not be filled).  This is one of my favorites.  Thanks!', '2008-02-12 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
