(4481156, 645346, 83080, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  The photo in the frame is obviously important (A wedding photo by your description), but the framed photo is slightly overpowered by the strength of the reflection.  Perhaps a different time of day could have balanced the two subjects better.  I really love the sentimental concept and give you high marks for creative thinking (which we need more of in this challenge).</td>', 'Interesting shot.  The photo in the frame is obviously important (A wedding photo by your description), but the framed photo is slightly overpowered by the strength of the reflection.  Perhaps a different time of day could have balanced the two subjects better.  I really love the sentimental concept and give you high marks for creative thinking (which we need more of in this challenge).', '2008-02-12 18:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
