(4481158, 644618, 55892, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you used the diagonal angle to inclued more of the top of the model.  It would have greately improved the shot. The umbrella &amp; the tree in the reflection leave me with a feeling of imcompleteness.  Beautiful reflection!</td>', 'I''m guessing you used the diagonal angle to inclued more of the top of the model.  It would have greately improved the shot. The umbrella & the tree in the reflection leave me with a feeling of imcompleteness.  Beautiful reflection!', '2008-02-12 18:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
