(4481173, 644426, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, composition, lighting, interesting reflection, cool lines.  I hope this shot seats you well towards the top.  Very creative.</td>', 'Nice colors, composition, lighting, interesting reflection, cool lines.  I hope this shot seats you well towards the top.  Very creative.', '2008-02-12 19:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481174, 645465, 88136, '<td valign="top">thats a kickass toaster</td>', 'thats a kickass toaster', '2008-02-12 19:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481175, 645561, 55892, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot! The sky in the top left is a great contrast with the tree &amp; the house.  The darkness of the ground at the edge of the water intensifies the puddle.  And the ripples in the puddle convey the recent energy of the storm.  One question: what is the smooth area on the top of the woodpile?  Is it a tarp?  That is the only part of the scene that doesn''t fit in, but again, an optistist could have put it there in a feeble attempt to keep the wood dry!</td>', 'This is a great shot! The sky in the top left is a great contrast with the tree & the house.  The darkness of the ground at the edge of the water intensifies the puddle.  And the ripples in the puddle convey the recent energy of the storm.  One question: what is the smooth area on the top of the woodpile?  Is it a tarp?  That is the only part of the scene that doesn''t fit in, but again, an optistist could have put it there in a feeble attempt to keep the wood dry!', '2008-02-12 19:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481178, 644176, 88136, '<td valign="top">lovely colors</td>', 'lovely colors', '2008-02-12 19:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
