(4481214, 644439, 55892, '<td valign="top">What a sweet kitty face! However, the reflection is distorted &amp; needs clarity.  How did you get that cat to pose there, let alone have him sit still for the fraction of a second that it took for you to snap the shot!</td>', 'What a sweet kitty face! However, the reflection is distorted & needs clarity.  How did you get that cat to pose there, let alone have him sit still for the fraction of a second that it took for you to snap the shot!', '2008-02-12 19:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481215, 645572, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea.  I''m sure you''ve been reminded by now that keeping your camera out of the shot was part of the challenge.  Other than that it works well.  The lighting on the subjects in the reflection is a little harsh in places.  Nice job being creative when most played it safe.</td>', 'Very cool idea.  I''m sure you''ve been reminded by now that keeping your camera out of the shot was part of the challenge.  Other than that it works well.  The lighting on the subjects in the reflection is a little harsh in places.  Nice job being creative when most played it safe.', '2008-02-12 19:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481217, 645592, 55892, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2008-02-12 19:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
