(4481232, 645325, 55892, '<td valign="top">Emotive! I really like the pose, and it is very dramaatic in b&amp;w.  The reflection didn''t turn out so good;  nice try.</td>', 'Emotive! I really like the pose, and it is very dramaatic in b&w.  The reflection didn''t turn out so good;  nice try.', '2008-02-12 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
