(4481263, 645536, 83080, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  The image seems a bit grainy (high iso?) and I''d be interested to see this without the dividing line centered (might have cropped some off of the left).  The angle of the reflection and overall effect is great.  Hope this does well as it''s much more unique than most.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  The image seems a bit grainy (high iso?) and I''d be interested to see this without the dividing line centered (might have cropped some off of the left).  The angle of the reflection and overall effect is great.  Hope this does well as it''s much more unique than most.', '2008-02-12 19:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481265, 645392, 55892, '<td valign="top">The colors are spectacular!  That is one of the most beautiful reflection I have ever seen!  The only way I could see to improve it would be to get the top of the trees in the frame; but that probably is unrealistic.</td>', 'The colors are spectacular!  That is one of the most beautiful reflection I have ever seen!  The only way I could see to improve it would be to get the top of the trees in the frame; but that probably is unrealistic.', '2008-02-12 19:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481275, 645050, 55892, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition, and the contrast of the brown &amp; black is good.  However, the reflections came out more like flares, affected the potential in this scene.  Better luck next time!</td>', 'This is a great composition, and the contrast of the brown & black is good.  However, the reflections came out more like flares, affected the potential in this scene.  Better luck next time!', '2008-02-12 19:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
