(4481708, 645353, 83845, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of home (ky).  Some different cropping IMO might help.  But I love this photo!</td>', 'Reminds me of home (ky).  Some different cropping IMO might help.  But I love this photo!', '2008-02-12 22:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481711, 644615, 83845, '<td valign="top">This is well done and perfect for the challenge!</td>', 'This is well done and perfect for the challenge!', '2008-02-12 22:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481720, 645564, 83845, '<td valign="top">It looks a little hazy in the water.  A beautiful fish!</td>', 'It looks a little hazy in the water.  A beautiful fish!', '2008-02-12 22:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481735, 645575, 83845, '<td valign="top">A very cute photo.</td>', 'A very cute photo.', '2008-02-12 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481761, 645462, 83845, '<td valign="top">WOW... i love the colors in this.  beautiful!</td>', 'WOW... i love the colors in this.  beautiful!', '2008-02-12 22:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481776, 644362, 83845, '<td valign="top">A great shot, would like to see a better b&amp;w transition.</td>', 'A great shot, would like to see a better b&w transition.', '2008-02-12 22:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481824, 645334, 81362, '<td valign="top">My vote for best in challenge. Love the splash of color and the impressionistic painting feeling. Having a beautiful entry that does not resort to the typical display of symmetry between the objects and their reflection helps make this a refreshing and very enjoyable image.</td>', 'My vote for best in challenge. Love the splash of color and the impressionistic painting feeling. Having a beautiful entry that does not resort to the typical display of symmetry between the objects and their reflection helps make this a refreshing and very enjoyable image.', '2008-02-12 23:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482192, 644768, 31535, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the green colour cast. Just my opinion.</td>', 'I don''t like the green colour cast. Just my opinion.', '2008-02-13 01:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482198, 644757, 31535, '<td valign="top">Great night shot. I feel the crop is a little too close on the bottom.</td>', 'Great night shot. I feel the crop is a little too close on the bottom.', '2008-02-13 01:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482204, 645546, 31535, '<td valign="top">Colours seem a little dull.</td>', 'Colours seem a little dull.', '2008-02-13 01:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482209, 642845, 31535, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool image. The contrast between the dark pavement and the red shoes if great. Adding it to my faves. 10</td>', 'This is such a cool image. The contrast between the dark pavement and the red shoes if great. Adding it to my faves. 10', '2008-02-13 01:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482225, 644713, 31535, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2008-02-13 01:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482243, 644560, 31535, '<td valign="top">I really like the colours.</td>', 'I really like the colours.', '2008-02-13 01:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482245, 645399, 31535, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. Not sure about the border though.</td>', 'Nice perspective. Not sure about the border though.', '2008-02-13 01:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482249, 645386, 31535, '<td valign="top">This has a very eerie feeling to it. Nice work.</td>', 'This has a very eerie feeling to it. Nice work.', '2008-02-13 01:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482253, 644626, 31535, '<td valign="top">Very nice gradient in the sky. Lights are bright but not overblown.</td>', 'Very nice gradient in the sky. Lights are bright but not overblown.', '2008-02-13 01:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482574, 644392, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the cloning aficionados would have you ''lose'' those cranes. For my part, all i can say is that the composition feels a little forced; I think because the natural line for the eye is from the boat house to the left, and that takes us out of frame pretty quickly.</td>', 'I''m sure the cloning aficionados would have you ''lose'' those cranes. For my part, all i can say is that the composition feels a little forced; I think because the natural line for the eye is from the boat house to the left, and that takes us out of frame pretty quickly.', '2008-02-13 05:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482581, 644326, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite pleasantly geometrical; the processing feels over-forced though - the shadows are brought so far up that the light feels unbalanced, and there''s a fringing to everything that feels unnatural - most especially visible in the edges of the trees against the sky.</td>', 'Quite pleasantly geometrical; the processing feels over-forced though - the shadows are brought so far up that the light feels unbalanced, and there''s a fringing to everything that feels unnatural - most especially visible in the edges of the trees against the sky.', '2008-02-13 05:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482583, 645494, 6999, '<td valign="top">Compositionally sensible image - enough black to give us isolation, but still enough image to see. Light and its treatment seems brutal though - highlights a bit overdone perhaps?</td>', 'Compositionally sensible image - enough black to give us isolation, but still enough image to see. Light and its treatment seems brutal though - highlights a bit overdone perhaps?', '2008-02-13 05:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482585, 645363, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good sense of composition - nice to have filled the top half of frame with something, rather than going with the temptation to isolate these two. It has something interesting to say about the structure of duck/goose, too, almost like an architectural exposition of three-quarter view and head-on.</td>', 'Good sense of composition - nice to have filled the top half of frame with something, rather than going with the temptation to isolate these two. It has something interesting to say about the structure of duck/goose, too, almost like an architectural exposition of three-quarter view and head-on.', '2008-02-13 05:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482859, 644752, 50695, '<td valign="top">I want a cut of your points...</td>', 'I want a cut of your points...', '2008-02-13 09:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482862, 643462, 50695, '<td valign="top">your two illusions cancel each other out and reveal the secret of both. nice composition, though.</td>', 'your two illusions cancel each other out and reveal the secret of both. nice composition, though.', '2008-02-13 09:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4482975, 644769, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice stuff; puts me in mind of a four-year-old''s photograph; pay no heed to the composition, sharpness, noise abatement tyrants, and get down and groove with the colours, dude.</td>', 'Nice stuff; puts me in mind of a four-year-old''s photograph; pay no heed to the composition, sharpness, noise abatement tyrants, and get down and groove with the colours, dude.', '2008-02-13 10:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483065, 644212, 6999, '<td valign="top">Such a mad, irrepressible image. It would be unclear what exactly the reflections are in this image even with the most perfect explanation. I like it for its sheer weirdness; the more so in a challenge.</td>', 'Such a mad, irrepressible image. It would be unclear what exactly the reflections are in this image even with the most perfect explanation. I like it for its sheer weirdness; the more so in a challenge.', '2008-02-13 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483077, 645602, 6999, '<td valign="top">Overly portentous title, perhaps: I''m never sure what really works, though. I like the subtlety of your use of reflections here, and the multiple meanings. Something of a cold fish, in the end, for my real taste, which is why this isn''t quite my favourite of the bunch this time round. Not quite.</td>', 'Overly portentous title, perhaps: I''m never sure what really works, though. I like the subtlety of your use of reflections here, and the multiple meanings. Something of a cold fish, in the end, for my real taste, which is why this isn''t quite my favourite of the bunch this time round. Not quite.', '2008-02-13 10:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483085, 643905, 31535, '<td valign="top">Really great capture. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Really great capture. One of my top picks.', '2008-02-13 10:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483093, 644543, 3569, '<td valign="top">Not just a Duck, but just a ring-necked Duck.  Great portrait and reflection of the duck  Van</td>', 'Not just a Duck, but just a ring-necked Duck.  Great portrait and reflection of the duck  Van', '2008-02-13 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483100, 643057, 3569, '<td valign="top">great rays and reflection</td>', 'great rays and reflection', '2008-02-13 10:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483104, 644543, 31535, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean. I think it might have been better had you put the duck to the left and showed his trailing ripples. I still like it though.</td>', 'Simple and clean. I think it might have been better had you put the duck to the left and showed his trailing ripples. I still like it though.', '2008-02-13 10:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483107, 645536, 25413, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but too symetrical IMO. And a lot of noise. It must be a long exposure. Very nice photo though.</td>', 'Nice photo but too symetrical IMO. And a lot of noise. It must be a long exposure. Very nice photo though.', '2008-02-13 10:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483110, 645319, 3569, '<td valign="top">not sure why ya tilted the stilt, but he may fall off at any time.  That''s not good</td>', 'not sure why ya tilted the stilt, but he may fall off at any time.  That''s not good', '2008-02-13 10:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483113, 645466, 3569, '<td valign="top">You were in the Keys.  Great Great White Heron.</td>', 'You were in the Keys.  Great Great White Heron.', '2008-02-13 10:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483116, 644752, 25413, '<td valign="top">Simple, fresh, nice lighting.</td>', 'Simple, fresh, nice lighting.', '2008-02-13 10:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483124, 644459, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful coot</td>', 'wonderful coot', '2008-02-13 10:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483129, 643278, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice Snowy Egret reflection</td>', 'nice Snowy Egret reflection', '2008-02-13 11:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483287, 645462, 42740, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2008-02-13 12:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483291, 645601, 42740, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2008-02-13 12:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483299, 644342, 42740, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but I actually find the people on the bridge take a little away from it.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'I really like this shot, but I actually find the people on the bridge take a little away from it. 8', '2008-02-13 12:10:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4483306, 645575, 42740, '<td valign="top">awww...</td>', 'awww...', '2008-02-13 12:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483322, 645443, 85926, '<td valign="top">stunning image. breathtaking.</td>', 'stunning image. breathtaking.', '2008-02-13 12:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483323, 645425, 85926, '<td valign="top">lovely b/w</td>', 'lovely b/w', '2008-02-13 12:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483343, 645363, 42740, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, but I think the composition is throwing me off a little.  Maybe if the geese had been closer together.  The fence? in the upper left corner also seems out of place.  The reflection is very nice, though. It does look like they''re getting ready to scrap.</td>', 'Nice reflection, but I think the composition is throwing me off a little.  Maybe if the geese had been closer together.  The fence? in the upper left corner also seems out of place.  The reflection is very nice, though. It does look like they''re getting ready to scrap.', '2008-02-13 12:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483699, 645461, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is quite intriguing.  Because of the sheet of ice, there are two distinctly separate worlds here that just happen to have a bit of resemblance here and there.</td>', 'This is quite intriguing.  Because of the sheet of ice, there are two distinctly separate worlds here that just happen to have a bit of resemblance here and there.', '2008-02-13 14:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483705, 644362, 30982, '<td valign="top">Just that one bit of reflected tree seems to signify that another world awaits - maybe one just as empty, maybe not.</td>', 'Just that one bit of reflected tree seems to signify that another world awaits - maybe one just as empty, maybe not.', '2008-02-13 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483715, 645370, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit like Germany.  The skies at least here where I live have been marvelously criss-crossed with contrails lately.</td>', 'Looks a bit like Germany.  The skies at least here where I live have been marvelously criss-crossed with contrails lately.', '2008-02-13 14:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483744, 644420, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the effect and I really like it upside down.  You may want to cut even more off the bottom - have just the bricks to anchor it.</td>', 'I like the effect and I really like it upside down.  You may want to cut even more off the bottom - have just the bricks to anchor it.', '2008-02-13 14:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483818, 644618, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and bright,interesting texture. The tilt works too.</td>', 'Nice and bright,interesting texture. The tilt works too.', '2008-02-13 15:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483822, 645595, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The comp leads my eye to the left, and then back to the upper right.</td>', 'Nicely done. The comp leads my eye to the left, and then back to the upper right.', '2008-02-13 15:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483827, 645049, 83313, '<td valign="top">Would have had more impact with me if the reflection colors were cranked up a touch more, but it''s still a solid 6 with me.</td>', 'Would have had more impact with me if the reflection colors were cranked up a touch more, but it''s still a solid 6 with me.', '2008-02-13 15:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483831, 645325, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wow... What a great image and a different interpretation of the theme.</td>', 'Wow... What a great image and a different interpretation of the theme.', '2008-02-13 15:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483838, 645425, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little busy, but it draws my eye up to the reflections in the windows quite nicely.</td>', 'A little busy, but it draws my eye up to the reflections in the windows quite nicely.', '2008-02-13 15:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483853, 645366, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m finding the intense purple sky here just comes on a little too strong for me. It seems to overpower the trees. I think a tighter crop on the trees to the left side  might have given it more oomph.</td>', 'I''m finding the intense purple sky here just comes on a little too strong for me. It seems to overpower the trees. I think a tighter crop on the trees to the left side  might have given it more oomph.', '2008-02-13 15:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483863, 645319, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit oversaturated to me, and not enough actual detail.</td>', 'Seems a bit oversaturated to me, and not enough actual detail.', '2008-02-13 15:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483882, 645568, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple &amp; obvious, but well done. I''m not sure about the comp, but the detail showing is great.</td>', 'Simple & obvious, but well done. I''m not sure about the comp, but the detail showing is great.', '2008-02-13 15:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483906, 645443, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, bet this gets a ribbon! I wonder if it''s in Iceland? The yellow lights in the houses are the icing on this beautiful image. Love the tones and blues!</td>', 'Ooooh, bet this gets a ribbon! I wonder if it''s in Iceland? The yellow lights in the houses are the icing on this beautiful image. Love the tones and blues!', '2008-02-13 15:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483914, 645366, 31133, '<td valign="top">Oh, so pretty. Such perfectly still water. I''m glad there are some stars ... I think without the stars, the image would be a tiny bit boring. The sky is actually my favorite part of this photograph. 6</td>', 'Oh, so pretty. Such perfectly still water. I''m glad there are some stars ... I think without the stars, the image would be a tiny bit boring. The sky is actually my favorite part of this photograph. 6', '2008-02-13 15:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483922, 643621, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of cool how you desaturated all but the picture on the wall to trick the viewer''s eye, especially if they''re going through these challenge pictures too fast!</td>', 'It''s kind of cool how you desaturated all but the picture on the wall to trick the viewer''s eye, especially if they''re going through these challenge pictures too fast!', '2008-02-13 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483924, 644576, 31535, '<td valign="top">Really striking tones.</td>', 'Really striking tones.', '2008-02-13 15:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483926, 645492, 31535, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective</td>', 'Nice perspective', '2008-02-13 16:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483932, 645366, 31535, '<td valign="top">I love the purple tint.</td>', 'I love the purple tint.', '2008-02-13 16:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483935, 643704, 31133, '<td valign="top">Very nice patterns! I like that you have chosen a unique reflective surface. It might have been nice without the peas or whatever those little spheres are too, or maybe just to have zoomed in so they were the subject. I find myself trying to figure out what they are more than looking at what should be the subject (I guess), which is those beautiful zebra stripes on the silverware.</td>', 'Very nice patterns! I like that you have chosen a unique reflective surface. It might have been nice without the peas or whatever those little spheres are too, or maybe just to have zoomed in so they were the subject. I find myself trying to figure out what they are more than looking at what should be the subject (I guess), which is those beautiful zebra stripes on the silverware.', '2008-02-13 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483936, 644333, 31133, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is painterly .... and looks like a really cold place! This is very pretty.</td>', 'Yes, it is painterly .... and looks like a really cold place! This is very pretty.', '2008-02-13 16:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483938, 645552, 31133, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit too strong on the boat itself, but the reflection is very nice.</td>', 'The light is a bit too strong on the boat itself, but the reflection is very nice.', '2008-02-13 16:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483953, 644651, 31133, '<td valign="top">Thanks to the framing and the very nice and varied colors, this reminds me of a storybook. Good job. It really inspires the imagination and fantasy.</td>', 'Thanks to the framing and the very nice and varied colors, this reminds me of a storybook. Good job. It really inspires the imagination and fantasy.', '2008-02-13 16:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483961, 645378, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love the 180 degree rotation of this. Such a great cityscape!</td>', 'I love the 180 degree rotation of this. Such a great cityscape!', '2008-02-13 16:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4484102, 644402, 77192, '<td valign="top">A mite oversharpened for me. Still a great shot though.</td>', 'A mite oversharpened for me. Still a great shot though.', '2008-02-13 17:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4484280, 644632, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wow, I totally love this for its uncluttered, natural beauty and power.</td>', 'Wow, I totally love this for its uncluttered, natural beauty and power.', '2008-02-13 18:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4484297, 645392, 90269, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning!', '2008-02-13 18:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4484968, 645580, 56880, '<td valign="top">Nice converging lines and color.</td>', 'Nice converging lines and color.', '2008-02-13 20:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485194, 645325, 83845, '<td valign="top">excellent, i love it!</td>', 'excellent, i love it!', '2008-02-13 21:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485199, 643621, 83845, '<td valign="top">The blindfold and thee yellow highlight puts the finishing touches on this.</td>', 'The blindfold and thee yellow highlight puts the finishing touches on this.', '2008-02-13 21:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485200, 645334, 83845, '<td valign="top">One of the few reflections that filled the frame... and it looks great!!</td>', 'One of the few reflections that filled the frame... and it looks great!!', '2008-02-13 21:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485261, 645555, 83845, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  I would like to see a little more leg :)</td>', 'I love this photo!  I would like to see a little more leg :)', '2008-02-13 21:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485280, 643021, 83845, '<td valign="top">For me, this is a top ten!... technically well done, tells a story, and no distractions.  Composition is great!  Love it!</td>', 'For me, this is a top ten!... technically well done, tells a story, and no distractions.  Composition is great!  Love it!', '2008-02-13 22:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485282, 644393, 83845, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photograph... well lit.  Reflection looks cool!</td>', 'A beautiful photograph... well lit.  Reflection looks cool!', '2008-02-13 22:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485289, 645599, 83845, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  Would love to see large scale.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  Would love to see large scale.', '2008-02-13 22:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485304, 645602, 83845, '<td valign="top">This is a reflection in a reflection in a reflection.  Out of curiosity, I wouldn''t mind seing the reflection of you in the egg and the eggs reflection a little better.  But a very very nice shot!!</td>', 'This is a reflection in a reflection in a reflection.  Out of curiosity, I wouldn''t mind seing the reflection of you in the egg and the eggs reflection a little better.  But a very very nice shot!!', '2008-02-13 22:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485309, 644702, 83845, '<td valign="top">This is very very nice.  I love the lines!!  ...and the depth from the fog!</td>', 'This is very very nice.  I love the lines!!  ...and the depth from the fog!', '2008-02-13 22:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485318, 645051, 83845, '<td valign="top">I love the colors!  I think that maybe a different crop would work wonders.  The foreground is really blurry.  Maybe crop that off?  End result might be a nicer horizontal composition.  It would even bring the reflection out more as well as the nice lines and curves at the top of the photograph.</td>', 'I love the colors!  I think that maybe a different crop would work wonders.  The foreground is really blurry.  Maybe crop that off?  End result might be a nicer horizontal composition.  It would even bring the reflection out more as well as the nice lines and curves at the top of the photograph.', '2008-02-13 22:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485353, 644787, 90277, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract look of this shot!</td>', 'I like the abstract look of this shot!', '2008-02-13 22:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485356, 644743, 90277, '<td valign="top">Excellent color captured!</td>', 'Excellent color captured!', '2008-02-13 22:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485361, 645462, 90277, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Great color captured!</td>', 'Nice shot!  Great color captured!', '2008-02-13 22:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485364, 645395, 83845, '<td valign="top">A beautiful flower, but a few distractions.  I might close in on the beautiful petals and leave the blurry leaf and most of the background out.  IMO...</td>', 'A beautiful flower, but a few distractions.  I might close in on the beautiful petals and leave the blurry leaf and most of the background out.  IMO...', '2008-02-13 22:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485370, 645566, 83845, '<td valign="top">givees me a good idea for a panning shot... works well with ''reflection'' too.</td>', 'givees me a good idea for a panning shot... works well with ''reflection'' too.', '2008-02-13 22:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485380, 644619, 74534, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how a little change, like a rotation, can throw a viewer so far away... all that would look familiar and I wouldn''t spend more than a microsecond on, now looks new and interesting... <br/> <br/>A couple of extra points for this original idea.</td>', 'It''s amazing how a little change, like a rotation, can throw a viewer so far away... all that would look familiar and I wouldn''t spend more than a microsecond on, now looks new and interesting...  A couple of extra points for this original idea.', '2008-02-13 22:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4485387, 645566, 74534, '<td valign="top">Well - there''s an original reflection! Extra points for the most unique challenge interpretation so far; unfortunately the image does not have much going for it otherwise...</td>', 'Well - there''s an original reflection! Extra points for the most unique challenge interpretation so far; unfortunately the image does not have much going for it otherwise...', '2008-02-13 22:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
