(4486703, 643909, 6999, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide whether I think this is extraordinary, or whether I think this banal. One could get all philosophical and say that its very banality is profound. Ideas of melting into the background, of simplicity, of being very very apposite to our times. The mystery of that expression is the killer at the moment - that''s what makes it. I''ll go for the former, I think. And whoever challenged it''s legitimacy needs their head examining.</td>', 'I can''t decide whether I think this is extraordinary, or whether I think this banal. One could get all philosophical and say that its very banality is profound. Ideas of melting into the background, of simplicity, of being very very apposite to our times. The mystery of that expression is the killer at the moment - that''s what makes it. I''ll go for the former, I think. And whoever challenged it''s legitimacy needs their head examining.', '2008-02-14 14:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486707, 645355, 6999, '<td valign="top">Another nearly banal image, but this saved by the terrific graphic sense of those reflections of lines.</td>', 'Another nearly banal image, but this saved by the terrific graphic sense of those reflections of lines.', '2008-02-14 14:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
