(4486832, 644479, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is my second look at this one, and believe me, my second looks is a much better impression than my first. I don''t know why I thought this was kind of boring first look ... now I think this is just wonderful (lucky I didn''t vote right away :-). I really like the light pole on the right and how the image is so dark at the top. The ripples and weeds around the clouds add some nice texture.</td>', 'This is my second look at this one, and believe me, my second looks is a much better impression than my first. I don''t know why I thought this was kind of boring first look ... now I think this is just wonderful (lucky I didn''t vote right away :-). I really like the light pole on the right and how the image is so dark at the top. The ripples and weeds around the clouds add some nice texture.', '2008-02-14 14:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486836, 642845, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love this! Very cool expression on the boy, in a very clear reflection. Crop and framing couldn''t be better.</td>', 'I love this! Very cool expression on the boy, in a very clear reflection. Crop and framing couldn''t be better.', '2008-02-14 14:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486853, 644576, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like your subject choice and I love the toning.  The only thing I can''t figure is why the water is so dark when the sky above is not.  Cool shot, though.</td>', 'I like your subject choice and I love the toning.  The only thing I can''t figure is why the water is so dark when the sky above is not.  Cool shot, though.', '2008-02-14 14:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486854, 644581, 30982, '<td valign="top">The reflected trees provide a nice framing bit for this.</td>', 'The reflected trees provide a nice framing bit for this.', '2008-02-14 14:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486856, 644619, 30982, '<td valign="top">This shows REALLY well - glad to hear it''s doing so well for you!</td>', 'This shows REALLY well - glad to hear it''s doing so well for you!', '2008-02-14 14:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486861, 645355, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pleased you chose this one.  I really like it, and like it even more each time I see it.  The squigglies (highly technical term) as you go further up the shot, contrasted with the relatively calm "ground" really do create some sort of metaphorical something that Posthumous could probably explain.  I just think it''s cool.</td>', 'Pleased you chose this one.  I really like it, and like it even more each time I see it.  The squigglies (highly technical term) as you go further up the shot, contrasted with the relatively calm "ground" really do create some sort of metaphorical something that Posthumous could probably explain.  I just think it''s cool.', '2008-02-14 15:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486863, 644581, 85097, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful sunrise capture.</td>', 'This is a beautiful sunrise capture.', '2008-02-14 15:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486865, 645472, 85097, '<td valign="top">great job capturing the reflections.</td>', 'great job capturing the reflections.', '2008-02-14 15:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486866, 645575, 85097, '<td valign="top">this is a little OOF and a little dark.  great idea though.</td>', 'this is a little OOF and a little dark.  great idea though.', '2008-02-14 15:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486867, 644451, 85097, '<td valign="top">I assume that there is a tree or something in the upper left?  It appears to be smoke coming from the building as the sunlight looks like flames.  If the title wasnt present I wouldnt have guessed a sunset.</td>', 'I assume that there is a tree or something in the upper left?  It appears to be smoke coming from the building as the sunlight looks like flames.  If the title wasnt present I wouldnt have guessed a sunset.', '2008-02-14 15:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486868, 644176, 85097, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture.</td>', 'beautiful capture.', '2008-02-14 15:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486869, 644447, 85097, '<td valign="top">the reflections look like a painting. I like this shot.</td>', 'the reflections look like a painting. I like this shot.', '2008-02-14 15:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486870, 645580, 85097, '<td valign="top">nice colors.</td>', 'nice colors.', '2008-02-14 15:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
