(4486881, 645332, 85097, '<td valign="top">love the reflections of the sun in the water.  The birds reflect nicely also.</td>', 'love the reflections of the sun in the water.  The birds reflect nicely also.', '2008-02-14 15:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
