(4487523, 645558, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, and that little wisp of steam is amazing.</td>', 'Nice reflection, and that little wisp of steam is amazing.', '2008-02-14 20:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4487527, 645366, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for purple.  And you got little stars in it, besides.  Nice shot; I love all the differently shaped trees.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for purple.  And you got little stars in it, besides.  Nice shot; I love all the differently shaped trees.', '2008-02-14 20:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4487531, 645601, 65234, '<td valign="top">That church looks rather one-dimensional, like it''s for a movie set.  Sorry; couldn''t help noticing.<br/> <br/>Nice mountain and reflection.</td>', 'That church looks rather one-dimensional, like it''s for a movie set.  Sorry; couldn''t help noticing. Nice mountain and reflection.', '2008-02-14 20:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4487541, 644619, 65234, '<td valign="top">You''re making me tilt my head and that is most unkind.  The tilt makes the most of the available space, granted, and the reflections are pretty darned cool ... well, I suppose if I didn''t keep trying to look at it with my eyes parallel to the horizon I wouldn''t be feeling so askew right now, so perhaps it is not entirely your fault ;-)<br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'You''re making me tilt my head and that is most unkind.  The tilt makes the most of the available space, granted, and the reflections are pretty darned cool ... well, I suppose if I didn''t keep trying to look at it with my eyes parallel to the horizon I wouldn''t be feeling so askew right now, so perhaps it is not entirely your fault ;-) Nice job.', '2008-02-14 20:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4487544, 645259, 59562, '<td valign="top">Awesome... )</td>', 'Awesome... )', '2008-02-14 20:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4487547, 644618, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very clever composition.  I do wish the person''s face didn''t look quite so masklike ... I think I would rather it either have more detail or less, but what it has is reminding me uncomfortably of a killer in a horror movie.  Sorry; I get imaginative sometimes!</td>', 'Very clever composition.  I do wish the person''s face didn''t look quite so masklike ... I think I would rather it either have more detail or less, but what it has is reminding me uncomfortably of a killer in a horror movie.  Sorry; I get imaginative sometimes!', '2008-02-14 20:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4487551, 644656, 65234, '<td valign="top">I do hope you included shot and processing details on this.  I''m quite fascinated by it!</td>', 'I do hope you included shot and processing details on this.  I''m quite fascinated by it!', '2008-02-14 20:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4487556, 645592, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s a spoon.  A common, average, everyday spoon.  That''s ... nothing short of amazingly creative.  I''m in awe.  I couldn''t possibly give this less than a 10.</td>', 'That''s a spoon.  A common, average, everyday spoon.  That''s ... nothing short of amazingly creative.  I''m in awe.  I couldn''t possibly give this less than a 10.', '2008-02-14 20:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4487562, 642845, 65234, '<td valign="top">There are some brilliant interpretations in this challenge, and this is most definitely one of them.  Wow.</td>', 'There are some brilliant interpretations in this challenge, and this is most definitely one of them.  Wow.', '2008-02-14 20:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
