(4490108, 644362, 31133, '<td valign="top">Everything we see is a reflection, so this (and all photographs) meet the challenge. But I still would like to see a regular reflection ... wait! I see it now, hidden like a "Where''s Waldo" picture, there in the foreground puddle. I thought that was a twig on the path at first. Okay.</td>', 'Everything we see is a reflection, so this (and all photographs) meet the challenge. But I still would like to see a regular reflection ... wait! I see it now, hidden like a "Where''s Waldo" picture, there in the foreground puddle. I thought that was a twig on the path at first. Okay.', '2008-02-16 03:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490109, 645435, 31133, '<td valign="top">Really like this, with the long face (plus, it reminds me of a joke :-). Only thing that might improve it for me is a bit more texture. It seems quite neat-imaged, especially around the face.</td>', 'Really like this, with the long face (plus, it reminds me of a joke :-). Only thing that might improve it for me is a bit more texture. It seems quite neat-imaged, especially around the face.', '2008-02-16 03:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490113, 642845, 90372, '<td valign="top">I think this image is unique in that it deviates from the classic landscape reflected in water theme. Additionally I feel that the title "Disconnect" is appropriate because the emotion of the boy''s face differs from the emotion of his body language. The boy''s face seems intensely serious while his body, with the feet rocked back slightly on the heels, emits anxiousness.</td>', 'I think this image is unique in that it deviates from the classic landscape reflected in water theme. Additionally I feel that the title "Disconnect" is appropriate because the emotion of the boy''s face differs from the emotion of his body language. The boy''s face seems intensely serious while his body, with the feet rocked back slightly on the heels, emits anxiousness.', '2008-02-16 03:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4490123, 645378, 77192, '<td valign="top">Wow! You''ve taken the "most obvious" idea and made something interesting and novel out of it. Composed brilliantly. Well done indeed!</td>', 'Wow! You''ve taken the "most obvious" idea and made something interesting and novel out of it. Composed brilliantly. Well done indeed!', '2008-02-16 04:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
