(4491659, 645330, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a decent scene with smooth colors in the clouds and sky, but the composition does not work for me. The sun being blocked by the tree seems odd to me and that side of the image is fighting with those gorgeous clouds. Meanwhile, the lower left of the scene seems pretty bare and overpowered by the rest of the image.<br/> <br/>A few feet to the right, with the whole scene framed by the overhanging tree branches, may have worked quite well.</td>', 'It''s a decent scene with smooth colors in the clouds and sky, but the composition does not work for me. The sun being blocked by the tree seems odd to me and that side of the image is fighting with those gorgeous clouds. Meanwhile, the lower left of the scene seems pretty bare and overpowered by the rest of the image. A few feet to the right, with the whole scene framed by the overhanging tree branches, may have worked quite well.', '2008-02-17 00:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4491671, 645435, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking. The "out of the box" crowd ought to really like this one.</td>', 'Very cool looking. The "out of the box" crowd ought to really like this one.', '2008-02-17 00:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
