(4492938, 645535, 83080, '<td valign="top">Touching photo (pun intended).  If I made a wild guess I would say this is a window reflecting some outdoor features and the hand is inside the window.  This is an excellent creative interpretation of the challenge to make texture with the reflection rather than making it the subject.  I hope this does well but I fear some may not take the time to think about it.</td>', 'Touching photo (pun intended).  If I made a wild guess I would say this is a window reflecting some outdoor features and the hand is inside the window.  This is an excellent creative interpretation of the challenge to make texture with the reflection rather than making it the subject.  I hope this does well but I fear some may not take the time to think about it.', '2008-02-17 17:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
