(4493478, 644720, 29011, '<td valign="top">Gotta love this. So simple yet enticing. Sweet idea using the grapefruit with the tangy red center and outer yellow radiance. Think it made a big different , in a better way than if you used an orange. Was the cut a bit lumpy?</td>', 'Gotta love this. So simple yet enticing. Sweet idea using the grapefruit with the tangy red center and outer yellow radiance. Think it made a big different , in a better way than if you used an orange. Was the cut a bit lumpy?', '2008-02-17 23:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
