(4493484, 642845, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Timfy! :) Really like your take.<br/>Glad this did so well. I remembered the similar shot but couldn''t put my finger on who''s it was, Saberi came to mind, but I was this close to checking out Larus. I should''ve known since I was following his PAW, doh. I didnt finish my round of bumps but this would''ve made it. I like how well the title fits the shot and with those clever accents ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-18 00:15:18.</i></td>', 'Congratulations Timfy! :) Really like your take.Glad this did so well. I remembered the similar shot but couldn''t put my finger on who''s it was, Saberi came to mind, but I was this close to checking out Larus. I should''ve known since I was following his PAW, doh. I didnt finish my round of bumps but this would''ve made it. I like how well the title fits the shot and with those clever accents ;)', '2008-02-18 00:02:14.000000', '2008-02-18 00:15:18.000000', 0),
