(4493534, 644448, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol I did not even see the title until now.  And I clearly got that this was a reflection.  I gave this a 6 because I too felt the right side should have been cropped.  If you do that, I think your pic will have this funky 3-D effect going for it.  It''s a great find!</td>', 'lol I did not even see the title until now.  And I clearly got that this was a reflection.  I gave this a 6 because I too felt the right side should have been cropped.  If you do that, I think your pic will have this funky 3-D effect going for it.  It''s a great find!', '2008-02-18 00:21:55.000000', NULL, 0),
