(4493598, 644619, 69008, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  You mentioned the "brown" sky. Try tungsten white balance some time for city shots at night.  <br/>I like it just as you posted it.  The X angle works.</td>', 'Congrats!  You mentioned the "brown" sky. Try tungsten white balance some time for city shots at night.  I like it just as you posted it.  The X angle works.', '2008-02-18 00:48:24.000000', NULL, 0),
