(4493610, 643278, 69008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and simple image. I like that I can see the yellow foot under the water in this. Perfect exposure.<br/>ETA ;  I feel that this would have scored better if the bird had been positioned to be moving into instead of out of the image. That''s not always possible with moving live animals. Still an beautiful image. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-18 00:57:04.</i></td>', 'Beautiful and simple image. I like that I can see the yellow foot under the water in this. Perfect exposure.ETA ;  I feel that this would have scored better if the bird had been positioned to be moving into instead of out of the image. That''s not always possible with moving live animals. Still an beautiful image. ', '2008-02-18 00:54:46.000000', '2008-02-18 00:57:04.000000', 0),
