(4493636, 645535, 83080, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! You have the #1 most under rated photo of the challenge.  That deserves a special award don''t you think?  I would give 2nd most under rated to <a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=645503" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ode to Harold</a> and 3rd to <a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=645568" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Kitchen</a>, but hey, that''s just my humble opinion.<br/> <br/>Thanks for such a thought provoking entry.</td>', 'Congratulations! You have the #1 most under rated photo of the challenge.  That deserves a special award don''t you think?  I would give 2nd most under rated to Ode to Harold and 3rd to Kitchen, but hey, that''s just my humble opinion. Thanks for such a thought provoking entry.', '2008-02-18 01:08:55.000000', NULL, 0),
