(4493648, 645503, 83080, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! You have the #2 most under rated photo of the challenge.  That deserves a special award don''t you think?  I would give 1st most under rated to <i><a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=645535" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">holding what you cannot reach</a></i> and 3rd to <i><a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=645568" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Kitchen</a></i>, but hey, that''s just my humble opinion.<br/> <br/>Thanks for such a thought provoking entry.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations! You have the #2 most under rated photo of the challenge.  That deserves a special award don''t you think?  I would give 1st most under rated to holding what you cannot reach and 3rd to Kitchen, but hey, that''s just my humble opinion. Thanks for such a thought provoking entry. ', '2008-02-18 01:15:19.000000', NULL, 0);
