(4493651, 645568, 83080, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! You have the third most under rated photo of the challenge.  That deserves a special award don''t you think?  I would give 1st most under rated to <i><a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=645535" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">holding what you cannot reach</a></i> and 2nd to <i><a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=645503" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ode to Harold</a></i>, but hey, that''s just my humble opinion.<br/> <br/>Thanks for such a thought provoking entry.</td>', 'Congratulations! You have the third most under rated photo of the challenge.  That deserves a special award don''t you think?  I would give 1st most under rated to holding what you cannot reach and 2nd to Ode to Harold, but hey, that''s just my humble opinion. Thanks for such a thought provoking entry.', '2008-02-18 01:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
