(4493794, 644116, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is quite wonderful - possibly too restrained, which is its virtue because it is enormously dramatic/graphic, for dpc, although this was a tough challenge to compete in.  The subtle contrast between the reflected trees and the trees themselves just enhances the pull of the verticals.</td>', 'This is quite wonderful - possibly too restrained, which is its virtue because it is enormously dramatic/graphic, for dpc, although this was a tough challenge to compete in.  The subtle contrast between the reflected trees and the trees themselves just enhances the pull of the verticals.', '2008-02-18 03:27:13.000000', NULL, 0),
