(4494153, 642845, 49804, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely incredible Tim, really great composition and great lighting, i absolutely loved this one when looking through the challenge during voting, very nicely done.</td>', 'This is absolutely incredible Tim, really great composition and great lighting, i absolutely loved this one when looking through the challenge during voting, very nicely done.', '2008-02-18 09:28:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494156, 644619, 49804, '<td valign="top">Awesome job Jeff, really love the tilted effect, and a really cool idea, very nicely done.</td>', 'Awesome job Jeff, really love the tilted effect, and a really cool idea, very nicely done.', '2008-02-18 09:29:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494158, 642845, 66193, '<td valign="top">Tim, congrats on the fantastic finish and wonderful shot!  And I agree with you 100% about the duplication of someone else''s shot.  For one, the great shots are not easy to copy anyway, and take real skill to execute.  Second, trying to duplicate a shot forces you to try over and over to get it right, and usually that means you learn something new while doing it.  Well done, Tim, and hang it on your wall with pride!</td>', 'Tim, congrats on the fantastic finish and wonderful shot!  And I agree with you 100% about the duplication of someone else''s shot.  For one, the great shots are not easy to copy anyway, and take real skill to execute.  Second, trying to duplicate a shot forces you to try over and over to get it right, and usually that means you learn something new while doing it.  Well done, Tim, and hang it on your wall with pride!', '2008-02-18 09:30:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494180, 644768, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this may have been too dark on some monitors and a lot of the stricter voters didn''t see it as a shot where "Reflection" was the main point.  On my monitor, the water is a very lovely rich green - quite nice, actually.</td>', 'I think this may have been too dark on some monitors and a lot of the stricter voters didn''t see it as a shot where "Reflection" was the main point.  On my monitor, the water is a very lovely rich green - quite nice, actually.', '2008-02-18 09:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494182, 642845, 61012, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a great shot. No problem with shooting your own take on a fine composition. Its no different than a musician covering a classic song. You took the idea and as they say. "made it your own"</td>', 'Congrats on a great shot. No problem with shooting your own take on a fine composition. Its no different than a musician covering a classic song. You took the idea and as they say. "made it your own"', '2008-02-18 09:41:44.000000', NULL, 0),
