(4494212, 643714, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is England?  I thought the sun never came out!  Very bright, very cheerful - I like the different aspects of things to see - the boats, the castles on the hill.  And the richness of the color in the reflection is very nice.</td>', 'This is England?  I thought the sun never came out!  Very bright, very cheerful - I like the different aspects of things to see - the boats, the castles on the hill.  And the richness of the color in the reflection is very nice.', '2008-02-18 10:07:02.000000', NULL, 0),
