(4494241, 644393, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on getting a new personal best!  You''re making very steady improvement from what I can see.  Very neat and uncluttered set up and well exposed.  I think I may have cropped down a bit - put more emphasis on the reflection.  Truly a great surface for reflections, too!</td>', 'Congrats on getting a new personal best!  You''re making very steady improvement from what I can see.  Very neat and uncluttered set up and well exposed.  I think I may have cropped down a bit - put more emphasis on the reflection.  Truly a great surface for reflections, too!', '2008-02-18 10:25:08.000000', NULL, 0),
