(4494266, 644656, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - I did indeed just invert the image to see if I could figure out the reflection part.  I kinda assumed it must be a print or a monitor but you did a great job mimicking the angles and the pose - and I''m quite amazed you held still for that long!  Good job of making us think!</td>', 'Heh - I did indeed just invert the image to see if I could figure out the reflection part.  I kinda assumed it must be a print or a monitor but you did a great job mimicking the angles and the pose - and I''m quite amazed you held still for that long!  Good job of making us think!', '2008-02-18 10:33:19.000000', NULL, 0),
