(4494412, 642845, 36988, '<td valign="top">Nicely done Tim! Unfortunate about having to explain yourself. We all get our inspiration from a variety of sources but the hard part is being able to pull it off in a convincing and professional manner. You performed admirably! You paid homage to Larus and said so... and I''m sure he''s thrilled. I would be. Remember... In a room full of balloons, there''s always going to be a prick or two. :)</td>', 'Nicely done Tim! Unfortunate about having to explain yourself. We all get our inspiration from a variety of sources but the hard part is being able to pull it off in a convincing and professional manner. You performed admirably! You paid homage to Larus and said so... and I''m sure he''s thrilled. I would be. Remember... In a room full of balloons, there''s always going to be a prick or two. :)', '2008-02-18 11:54:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494413, 645346, 3724, '<td valign="top">8 - lovely work. Interesting &amp; appropriate title.</td>', '8 - lovely work. Interesting & appropriate title.', '2008-02-18 11:56:32.000000', NULL, 0),
