(4494637, 645366, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top 10!  This was one of my 8s.  Beautiful colors and the stars are just a bonus.</td>', 'Congrats on top 10!  This was one of my 8s.  Beautiful colors and the stars are just a bonus.', '2008-02-18 13:51:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494641, 645378, 60862, '<td valign="top">You got a 9 from me, plus a fave.  This was one of the best in the challenge, so congrats on your top 10 and new personal best!  I was actually surprised you hadn''t scored so high before.  :)</td>', 'You got a 9 from me, plus a fave.  This was one of the best in the challenge, so congrats on your top 10 and new personal best!  I was actually surprised you hadn''t scored so high before.  :)', '2008-02-18 13:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494644, 643704, 60862, '<td valign="top">Cool layout and swirlies, Ralph.  Congrats on top 10!</td>', 'Cool layout and swirlies, Ralph.  Congrats on top 10!', '2008-02-18 13:53:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494646, 644615, 60862, '<td valign="top">This works very well - just love the frog peeking out in the reflection.  Congrats on top 10!</td>', 'This works very well - just love the frog peeking out in the reflection.  Congrats on top 10!', '2008-02-18 13:53:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494650, 643462, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea, great result.  Thanks for sharing your technique!  Congrats on the top 20. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-18 13:55:32.</i></td>', 'Very cool idea, great result.  Thanks for sharing your technique!  Congrats on the top 20. :)', '2008-02-18 13:55:09.000000', '2008-02-18 13:55:32.000000', 0),
(4494653, 645334, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really liked this - had a surreal feel for me.  Congrats on your new 2nd-best score and top 20!</td>', 'I really liked this - had a surreal feel for me.  Congrats on your new 2nd-best score and top 20!', '2008-02-18 13:56:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494655, 645392, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and shapes.  Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'Nice colors and shapes.  Congrats on top 20!', '2008-02-18 13:57:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494657, 644658, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really liked how the reflections make it look like the real world is floating over emptiness.  Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'I really liked how the reflections make it look like the real world is floating over emptiness.  Congrats on top 20!', '2008-02-18 13:57:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494663, 645598, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.  I especially like the rocks and how they almost touch the reflection.  Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'Nice angle.  I especially like the rocks and how they almost touch the reflection.  Congrats on top 20!', '2008-02-18 13:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494665, 643905, 60862, '<td valign="top">I think this is just beautiful not only the sky, but the pose and the shapes - got a 9 from me.  Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'I think this is just beautiful not only the sky, but the pose and the shapes - got a 9 from me.  Congrats on top 20!', '2008-02-18 13:59:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494668, 645259, 60862, '<td valign="top">Floating feathers are a little overdone on DPC for reflections, but this is a nice version of the concept.  Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'Floating feathers are a little overdone on DPC for reflections, but this is a nice version of the concept.  Congrats on top 20!', '2008-02-18 14:00:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494670, 644576, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones and shapes in this.  I voted it an 8 and it''s going in my faves.  Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'I really like the tones and shapes in this.  I voted it an 8 and it''s going in my faves.  Congrats on top 20!', '2008-02-18 14:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494673, 645458, 60862, '<td valign="top">Really pretty colors, and I like very much how the boundary between reality and the "faery" world is indistinct.  Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'Really pretty colors, and I like very much how the boundary between reality and the "faery" world is indistinct.  Congrats on top 20!', '2008-02-18 14:01:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494677, 644342, 60862, '<td valign="top">I enjoy shots where the boundary between real and reflected is a little hard to find, so this is great.  The people add a nice bonus.  Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'I enjoy shots where the boundary between real and reflected is a little hard to find, so this is great.  The people add a nice bonus.  Congrats on top 20!', '2008-02-18 14:02:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494683, 645492, 60862, '<td valign="top">Keep doing what you want.  No matter what style, someone won''t like it, so you should make yourself happy.  I liked this shot a lot, for both the rich gold and the shapes against the sky.</td>', 'Keep doing what you want.  No matter what style, someone won''t like it, so you should make yourself happy.  I liked this shot a lot, for both the rich gold and the shapes against the sky.', '2008-02-18 14:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494689, 645592, 60862, '<td valign="top">Another interesting, richly detailed graphic-looking shot from you, Robert.  Well done!</td>', 'Another interesting, richly detailed graphic-looking shot from you, Robert.  Well done!', '2008-02-18 14:05:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494691, 644752, 60862, '<td valign="top">Heh.  I wish my mornings felt as soft and comforting as this shot does.  Well done! :)</td>', 'Heh.  I wish my mornings felt as soft and comforting as this shot does.  Well done! :)', '2008-02-18 14:06:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494693, 644743, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  The shapes, colors, and composition all add up well.  Congrats!</td>', 'This is beautiful.  The shapes, colors, and composition all add up well.  Congrats!', '2008-02-18 14:07:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494707, 645450, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really liked this, Les - gave it a 7.  It has a science fiction feel, like these buildings are floating in space.</td>', 'I really liked this, Les - gave it a 7.  It has a science fiction feel, like these buildings are floating in space.', '2008-02-18 14:09:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494709, 645334, 57358, '<td valign="top">I like the person on the left, it adds more interest to the photo.  I also think the girl and the dog wouldn''t have taken up enough verticle space to balance the birch trees.  I also love how you captured the scene in such a way that it looks like an old painting - if I didn''t know better, I would have thought you put a filter on it.</td>', 'I like the person on the left, it adds more interest to the photo.  I also think the girl and the dog wouldn''t have taken up enough verticle space to balance the birch trees.  I also love how you captured the scene in such a way that it looks like an old painting - if I didn''t know better, I would have thought you put a filter on it.', '2008-02-18 14:09:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494721, 643692, 45689, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your points &amp; comments.</td>', 'Thanks for all your points & comments.', '2008-02-18 14:10:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494724, 644618, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea, and I like the color pop from the umbrella.</td>', 'Very nice idea, and I like the color pop from the umbrella.', '2008-02-18 14:11:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494734, 643049, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your new personal best and beating 6 for the first time! :)  I saw the face in the trumpet right away and thought it was a clever entry.</td>', 'Congrats on your new personal best and beating 6 for the first time! :)  I saw the face in the trumpet right away and thought it was a clever entry.', '2008-02-18 14:14:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494737, 643714, 60862, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene, Sara.  Reminds me of paintings I''ve seen of harbors.</td>', 'Pretty scene, Sara.  Reminds me of paintings I''ve seen of harbors.', '2008-02-18 14:15:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494738, 645386, 18450, '<td valign="top">Early morning solitude. What a wonderful shot!!!</td>', 'Early morning solitude. What a wonderful shot!!!', '2008-02-18 14:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494758, 643704, 51538, '<td valign="top">Certainly an outstanding photo and the balls are OK with me.  Well done.</td>', 'Certainly an outstanding photo and the balls are OK with me.  Well done.', '2008-02-18 14:22:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494783, 645464, 30982, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites in the challenge - well done!</td>', 'This was one of my favorites in the challenge - well done!', '2008-02-18 14:32:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494848, 642845, 68586, '<td valign="top">Tim - I didn''t vote in this challenge, but a great shot and your right - this will look great on your wall for years to come.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the Blue.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Tim - I didn''t vote in this challenge, but a great shot and your right - this will look great on your wall for years to come. Congrats on the Blue. ', '2008-02-18 15:05:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4494860, 645454, 68586, '<td valign="top">Under 6 ?? This is way too low - you have wonderful reflections of both the bubbles on the surface, and the surface on the bubbles  :  )<br/> <br/>This is technically and conceptually delightful.<br/> <br/>Should have been top ten.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Under 6 ?? This is way too low - you have wonderful reflections of both the bubbles on the surface, and the surface on the bubbles  :  ) This is technically and conceptually delightful. Should have been top ten. ', '2008-02-18 15:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495131, 642592, 42013, '<td valign="top">Suprised it didn''t do better Joe. I thought it had good texture throughout, nice reflection, very natural looking(really doesn''t look HDR''d), yada yada. O well, next time...</td>', 'Suprised it didn''t do better Joe. I thought it had good texture throughout, nice reflection, very natural looking(really doesn''t look HDR''d), yada yada. O well, next time...', '2008-02-18 17:04:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495261, 645443, 46853, '<td valign="top">Congrats.<br/>Til hamingju.  Flottir litir og ljósin í gluggunum.</td>', 'Congrats.Til hamingju.  Flottir litir og ljósin í gluggunum.', '2008-02-18 17:28:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495353, 642845, 56744, '<td valign="top">Tim, congrats for the brilliant reproduction of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27482" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Larus</a> shot. I think you did catch the idea perfectly and executed it with great control.</td>', 'Tim, congrats for the brilliant reproduction of  Larus shot. I think you did catch the idea perfectly and executed it with great control.', '2008-02-18 17:55:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495363, 644766, 56744, '<td valign="top">"Beautiful" is a word that goes very well with your work, this image included. Congrats Irene</td>', '"Beautiful" is a word that goes very well with your work, this image included. Congrats Irene', '2008-02-18 17:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495387, 643905, 56744, '<td valign="top">Julia, your "most common subject matter" usually doesn''t appeal me but you do magic with your camera turning overlooked images into pieces of art. Thanks for the pleasure I always get when watching to your work.</td>', 'Julia, your "most common subject matter" usually doesn''t appeal me but you do magic with your camera turning overlooked images into pieces of art. Thanks for the pleasure I always get when watching to your work.', '2008-02-18 18:10:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495629, 645492, 57358, '<td valign="top">Since when does art have to look like real life?  I thought the point of art was to create aesthetically pleasing pieces...  imho, the beauty of the end result is all that matters.  I love the subtlety of the reflections in this photo.</td>', 'Since when does art have to look like real life?  I thought the point of art was to create aesthetically pleasing pieces...  imho, the beauty of the end result is all that matters.  I love the subtlety of the reflections in this photo.', '2008-02-18 19:39:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495678, 644619, 56744, '<td valign="top">That angle creates a powerful image. Great decision &amp; Congrasts on your high finish.</td>', 'That angle creates a powerful image. Great decision & Congrasts on your high finish.', '2008-02-18 19:53:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495684, 644757, 56744, '<td valign="top">Great job with the light.</td>', 'Great job with the light.', '2008-02-18 19:55:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495729, 642845, 56658, '<td valign="top">Great shot. For what its worth I like yours better and plan on stealing this idea in the future:)</td>', 'Great shot. For what its worth I like yours better and plan on stealing this idea in the future:)', '2008-02-18 20:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495772, 644619, 20539, '<td valign="top">nice<br/>looks like butterfly knife in motion</td>', 'nicelooks like butterfly knife in motion', '2008-02-18 20:35:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495812, 644702, 60701, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the new PB</td>', 'Congrats on the new PB', '2008-02-18 20:46:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495938, 642845, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty amazing.  Congrats.</td>', 'Pretty amazing.  Congrats.', '2008-02-18 21:09:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496003, 644615, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lovely. What a pose.</td>', 'Lovely. What a pose.', '2008-02-18 21:22:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496147, 644787, 69008, '<td valign="top">This image makes light do stuff! <br/>I''m surprised that no one has made any comments since the challenge ended. I didn''t vote, but I did like this shot a lot while browsing thru the challenge images. <br/>There is a nice "dragon" heading down the left edge of the reflected buildings.</td>', 'This image makes light do stuff! I''m surprised that no one has made any comments since the challenge ended. I didn''t vote, but I did like this shot a lot while browsing thru the challenge images. There is a nice "dragon" heading down the left edge of the reflected buildings.', '2008-02-18 22:08:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496264, 645303, 45475, '<td valign="top">I think I see where you were going with this... *tilts head down then up* ... somehow, the composition just feels right diagonally. Regardless of tilt, this is quite an exceptional image. The 5+ votes tell the story. Makes me wonder though... when IS it appropriate to tilt? Seems to unnerve people a lot, doesn''t it? :)</td>', 'I think I see where you were going with this... *tilts head down then up* ... somehow, the composition just feels right diagonally. Regardless of tilt, this is quite an exceptional image. The 5+ votes tell the story. Makes me wonder though... when IS it appropriate to tilt? Seems to unnerve people a lot, doesn''t it? :)', '2008-02-18 22:45:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496337, 644448, 34462, '<td valign="top">Jon, First you drive on the wrong side of the road on a round-about and now you have the time backwards. Oh wait... it''s a reflection. Wonderful, It''d be cool to see how this looked with a closer crop. Love the title.<br/></td>', 'Jon, First you drive on the wrong side of the road on a round-about and now you have the time backwards. Oh wait... it''s a reflection. Wonderful, It''d be cool to see how this looked with a closer crop. Love the title.', '2008-02-18 23:24:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496347, 642845, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is so great!  Very well done! (As usual.)</td>', 'This is so great!  Very well done! (As usual.)', '2008-02-18 23:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496435, 644757, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours and reflection. Super image, Oliver.</td>', 'Wonderful colours and reflection. Super image, Oliver.', '2008-02-19 00:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496518, 642845, 61654, '<td valign="top">I really love this.  Excellent work.</td>', 'I really love this.  Excellent work.', '2008-02-19 00:48:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496668, 644619, 66384, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot, Jeffrey. Congratulations !!! At first (for just a moment) I thought it was a sword cutting through something. I particularly like what you have done with the color.</td>', 'Fabulous shot, Jeffrey. Congratulations !!! At first (for just a moment) I thought it was a sword cutting through something. I particularly like what you have done with the color.', '2008-02-19 01:32:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496754, 644702, 68504, '<td valign="top">Ditto pineapple. Light touch.</td>', 'Ditto pineapple. Light touch.', '2008-02-19 02:28:07.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4496757, 644787, 42013, '<td valign="top">I thought it was one of the more intriquing entries in the reflections challenge. IN particular the distortion of the reflection contrasted with the rigid squares.</td>', 'I thought it was one of the more intriquing entries in the reflections challenge. IN particular the distortion of the reflection contrasted with the rigid squares.', '2008-02-19 02:33:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496800, 645443, 34956, '<td valign="top">Til hamingju. Frábær mynd flottir litir og speglun.</td>', 'Til hamingju. Frábær mynd flottir litir og speglun.', '2008-02-19 04:34:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496857, 644619, 70828, '<td valign="top">WOW, Jeffrey! Awesome image! Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'WOW, Jeffrey! Awesome image! Congrats on the HM!', '2008-02-19 05:54:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496873, 643692, 14614, '<td valign="top">such a beautiful range of blues - makes me cold and warm at the same time.  Congrats on the fine finish.</td>', 'such a beautiful range of blues - makes me cold and warm at the same time.  Congrats on the fine finish.', '2008-02-19 06:22:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4496874, 645378, 14614, '<td valign="top">Quite a great package here - cropping, composition, tones, and title all work together.  Congrats on the PB.</td>', 'Quite a great package here - cropping, composition, tones, and title all work together.  Congrats on the PB.', '2008-02-19 06:24:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4497215, 642845, 52115, '<td valign="top">Way to go, Tim, You''re on a roll. Shooting your kids in a cemetary. That''s okay, just don''t make him wear a pink tutu.</td>', 'Way to go, Tim, You''re on a roll. Shooting your kids in a cemetary. That''s okay, just don''t make him wear a pink tutu.', '2008-02-19 09:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4497353, 645454, 10665, '<td valign="top">I would love to know how you did this, I was trying to do something similar and the bubbles kept bursting before I could get the shot off.</td>', 'I would love to know how you did this, I was trying to do something similar and the bubbles kept bursting before I could get the shot off.', '2008-02-19 10:01:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4497493, 644766, 43714, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful Irene, you rock!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Simply beautiful Irene, you rock!!!!!!!!!!', '2008-02-19 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4497512, 644757, 74559, '<td valign="top">The colors are stunning, and the glowing gold lattice roof is fantastic!</td>', 'The colors are stunning, and the glowing gold lattice roof is fantastic!', '2008-02-19 11:13:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4497538, 644027, 80912, '<td valign="top">Just FYI -<br/> <br/>The "wood" on the right is actually concrete (an interior wall). I probably should have cropped it out, but I thought it added an interesting texture. Maybe w/ the books and the blinds and the grain on the door it was just too much.<br/> <br/>And during voting, I noticed that the thumbnail didn''t really show the reflection very well - I wonder if that hurt it, too.</td>', 'Just FYI - The "wood" on the right is actually concrete (an interior wall). I probably should have cropped it out, but I thought it added an interesting texture. Maybe w/ the books and the blinds and the grain on the door it was just too much. And during voting, I noticed that the thumbnail didn''t really show the reflection very well - I wonder if that hurt it, too.', '2008-02-19 11:27:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4497657, 644766, 52115, '<td valign="top">A shot in hand is worth two lilies next week. You have puddles in your house? It must be the accumulation of water drops.</td>', 'A shot in hand is worth two lilies next week. You have puddles in your house? It must be the accumulation of water drops.', '2008-02-19 12:19:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4497948, 644766, 65468, '<td valign="top">This image is breathtaking and in IMHO should have 1st.  Congrats on ribbon</td>', 'This image is breathtaking and in IMHO should have 1st.  Congrats on ribbon', '2008-02-19 13:46:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4498189, 644766, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the lighting!<br/>BTW we''re doing smoke photography with the Photography Society tomorrow and I told our members to look at your pbase collection to get some inspiration.</td>', 'Nice work on the lighting!BTW we''re doing smoke photography with the Photography Society tomorrow and I told our members to look at your pbase collection to get some inspiration.', '2008-02-19 15:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4498235, 645563, 67145, '<td valign="top">brilliant colours .. love the graphic look .. :)</td>', 'brilliant colours .. love the graphic look .. :)', '2008-02-19 15:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4498358, 644743, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hey there neighbor!  Very lovely shot you have here!  DOF is perfect, reflection is gorgeous, and you even have the water drops that I forgot!  :-)  Seriously, though, this is really beautiful.</td>', 'Hey there neighbor!  Very lovely shot you have here!  DOF is perfect, reflection is gorgeous, and you even have the water drops that I forgot!  :-)  Seriously, though, this is really beautiful.', '2008-02-19 16:27:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4498701, 645572, 55838, '<td valign="top">Totally<br/>R<br/>O<br/>B<br/>B<br/>E<br/>D<br/>!!!!!!!</td>', 'TotallyROBBED!!!!!!!', '2008-02-19 19:48:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499276, 644766, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty.  I liked the glow of light reflecting the underside of the flower.  It makes it look like silk.  Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'This is so pretty.  I liked the glow of light reflecting the underside of the flower.  It makes it look like silk.  Congrats on the ribbon!', '2008-02-19 23:23:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499529, 645355, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, Peter. The shiny surface of the water, the gentle distortion, the warm colors. It''s going in my favorites.</td>', 'I really like this image, Peter. The shiny surface of the water, the gentle distortion, the warm colors. It''s going in my favorites.', '2008-02-20 00:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499859, 643704, 46336, '<td valign="top">Hi Ralph. <br/>Superb - you really do excel at this style of shot. Well done. <br/>Cheers<br/>Paul</td>', 'Hi Ralph. Superb - you really do excel at this style of shot. Well done. CheersPaul', '2008-02-20 02:41:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499888, 644787, 18450, '<td valign="top">It''s fascinating!</td>', 'It''s fascinating!', '2008-02-20 03:10:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4500187, 642845, 28710, '<td valign="top">A real standout on the front page. Nicely done and congrats on the 0 1''s. Woo!</td>', 'A real standout on the front page. Nicely done and congrats on the 0 1''s. Woo!', '2008-02-20 07:33:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4500268, 642845, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hey Tim, way to go!  Congrats on the ribbon and glad to have inspired you :)  <br/> <br/>For those of you who are nagging about him "stealing" the idea, get over it!  It´s hardly like I invented this type of shot, it´s been done before and I got the idea from a b/w magazine I read a couple of years ago wich had legs in the top part of the photo, cropped off and the face visible in a puddle but didn´t resemble my or Tim´s shot in any other way.  Tim took the shot and did it his own way and was far from copying my shot so why should it matter where he got the basic idea from, wether that was from DPC or some other source, does that really matter?  I think some people need to realize that there is a whole world of photography outside of DPC.<br/> <br/>Thx for the credit Tim and congrats once again :)<br/></td>', 'Hey Tim, way to go!  Congrats on the ribbon and glad to have inspired you :)   For those of you who are nagging about him "stealing" the idea, get over it!  It´s hardly like I invented this type of shot, it´s been done before and I got the idea from a b/w magazine I read a couple of years ago wich had legs in the top part of the photo, cropped off and the face visible in a puddle but didn´t resemble my or Tim´s shot in any other way.  Tim took the shot and did it his own way and was far from copying my shot so why should it matter where he got the basic idea from, wether that was from DPC or some other source, does that really matter?  I think some people need to realize that there is a whole world of photography outside of DPC. Thx for the credit Tim and congrats once again :)', '2008-02-20 08:19:36.000000', NULL, 0),
