(4501372, 642845, 39218, '<td valign="top">I think it is awesome of course, but that puts me in amongst the highest percentile, I am sure.  <br/> <br/>First off... my first reaction upon seeing this is that I couldn''t wait to do it with my grandaughters, and then I thought it was great that you mentioned that it was a ''blatant rip-off'' of Larus''s work, even though it was not necessary to mention that at all.  It gave you tons of credibility in my book.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the capture of the ribbon... but as you said, it''s on your wall either way.<br/> <br/>Cute little guy.  He deserves a Pizza Party!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think it is awesome of course, but that puts me in amongst the highest percentile, I am sure.   First off... my first reaction upon seeing this is that I couldn''t wait to do it with my grandaughters, and then I thought it was great that you mentioned that it was a ''blatant rip-off'' of Larus''s work, even though it was not necessary to mention that at all.  It gave you tons of credibility in my book. Congratulations on the capture of the ribbon... but as you said, it''s on your wall either way. Cute little guy.  He deserves a Pizza Party!!!! ', '2008-02-20 14:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
