(4502359, 644619, 82814, '<td valign="top">I had to comment on this image once more because I am very impressed with it.  Shame on the dickweeds who were compelled to vote 5 or lower on this shot for whatever ridiculous reasoning takes up space in their tiny minds.  By voting so low on a clearly talented capture, you abuse the privilege and your obligation to be both objective and realistic in your voting of other peoples fine photographic works.  I gave this shot a 9 during the voting period because it has a wonderful composition, very good detail &amp; clarity, and met the challenge criteria.</td>', 'I had to comment on this image once more because I am very impressed with it.  Shame on the dickweeds who were compelled to vote 5 or lower on this shot for whatever ridiculous reasoning takes up space in their tiny minds.  By voting so low on a clearly talented capture, you abuse the privilege and your obligation to be both objective and realistic in your voting of other peoples fine photographic works.  I gave this shot a 9 during the voting period because it has a wonderful composition, very good detail & clarity, and met the challenge criteria.', '2008-02-20 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 0),
