(4510335, 645517, 61651, '<td valign="top">The turtles'' *world* is the subject, right? The turtles don''t need to be the centerpiece.  You''ve got a good breadth of the reflection included here; for me, the shot might have more impact if there was more contrast among the tones, though.</td>', 'The turtles'' *world* is the subject, right? The turtles don''t need to be the centerpiece.  You''ve got a good breadth of the reflection included here; for me, the shot might have more impact if there was more contrast among the tones, though.', '2008-02-23 16:28:09.000000', NULL, 0),
