(4510351, 644752, 61651, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I want a cut of your points... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>heh, heh...can I have some too?  Really glad you went for this, and even more glad that DPC considered this a 6+ - it deserves it.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: I want a cut of your points...   heh, heh...can I have some too?  Really glad you went for this, and even more glad that DPC considered this a 6+ - it deserves it.', '2008-02-23 16:37:08.000000', NULL, 0),
