(6482956, 645386, 75713, '<td valign="top">When I saw your name on the sc list, I realized I didn''t know your work so I thought I would go and have a peek and this was my first peek.  Wow.  What an excellent photo - a masterful use of the fish eye - I would love to walk that road in the fog - the reflection is understated but perfect. I love the bush in the f/g. The composition is outstanding as is your choice in the dual tone tint. <br/> <br/>Now I have to go and look some more.  I love finding new (to me) photographers I admire.</td>', 'When I saw your name on the sc list, I realized I didn''t know your work so I thought I would go and have a peek and this was my first peek.  Wow.  What an excellent photo - a masterful use of the fish eye - I would love to walk that road in the fog - the reflection is understated but perfect. I love the bush in the f/g. The composition is outstanding as is your choice in the dual tone tint.  Now I have to go and look some more.  I love finding new (to me) photographers I admire.', '2011-07-28 01:11:28.000000', NULL, 0),
